flowchart TD
    S([Start]) --> D[/Display Administrator Dashboard/]
    D --> M{Select module}
    M -->|Learner records| M1[Open Learner Records]
    M -->|Learning content| M2[Open Chapters and Lessons]
    M -->|Question Bank| M3[Open Question Bank]
    M -->|Practice sets| M4[Open Practice Sets]
    M -->|Mock exam sets| M5[Open Mock Exam Sets]
    M -->|Road Sign Game| M6[Open Game Sets and Road Sign Assets]
    M1 --> A{Select action}
    M2 --> A
    M3 --> A
    M4 --> A
    M5 --> A
    M6 --> A
    A -->|View| V[/Display records/]
    A -->|Add| AD[Enter details]
    A -->|Edit| ED[Update details]
    A -->|Activate or deactivate| ST[Change status]
    A -->|Delete| CF{Confirm delete?}
    AD --> VL{Details valid?}
    ED --> VL
    VL -->|No| VX[/Display error message/]
    VX --> A
    VL -->|Yes| SV[Save to database]
    ST --> SV
    SV --> OK[/Display success message/]
    CF -->|No| A
    CF -->|Yes| PR{Record protected from deletion?}
    PR -->|Yes| NO[/Display cannot delete message/]
    PR -->|No| DL[Delete from database]
    DL --> OK
    V --> MORE{Another action?}
    OK --> MORE
    NO --> MORE
    MORE -->|Yes| A
    MORE -->|No| E([End])
